#: ../../operations.rst:2134
msgid ""
"Both processes must run as the same user. The socket file has mode 0600, "
"and each end checks the user of the other. Each daemon needs a path of "
"its own: a new process that finds a daemon with other addresses at the "
"path gives up with ``UPG008``. A start with this key replaces a running "
"daemon, so starting the service twice no longer fails with ADDRESS IN USE."
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations.rst:2136
